## 11. Reporting — {{set_by}}
{{reporting_push}}
- A short wrap at the end of every trading day; hourly checks that take no action stay silent.
- A weekly review and re-plan every Sunday (STRATEGY.md is rewritten then), and a mid-week review after a loss limit trips.
